==============================================================================
  Assay Planner -- OTX-004-IT-lncRNA-NEAT1
==============================================================================
  Assay Planner | OTX-004-IT-lncRNA-NEAT1 | lncRNA_targeting | naked

  P1 -- Essential (9 assays)
  Assay                                           Endpoint                Species
  ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  28-day repeat-dose tox (rat+cynomolgus)         hepatocellular_injury   rat+cyno
    >> GLP histopathology: H&E+Masson. ICH S7A core package.
  PF4-PS ELISA                                    thrombocytopenia        cynomolgus
    >> PF4-PS complex; anti-PF4 Ab.
  Platelet-bound C3d/C4d flow cytometry           complement_activation   human ex vivo
    >> Complement-opsonized platelet clearance; CARPA mechanism.
  Trp:Kyn HPLC-MS                                 cytokine_release        rat/plasma
    >> IDO1/kynurenine pathway.
  lncRNA hub connectivity + network RNA-seq       offtarget_gene_silencin human cell line
    >> lncRNA hub disruption; D2 ncRNA off-target network (ICH S6R1).
  Micropeptide ELISA / ribosome profiling         offtarget_gene_silencin human cell line
    >> Micropeptide co-depletion risk.
  Cynomolgus ortholog verification                offtarget_gene_silencin cynomolgus
    >> Human-specific lncRNA bridging strategy.
  EFD microphysiological system (ICH S5.3)        cns_toxicity            MPS/human
    >> DART human-specific sequence alternative.
  Surrogate sequence FDA pre-IND consultation     cns_toxicity            rat/cyno
    >> DART bridging via surrogate; pre-IND meeting.

  P2 -- Recommended (3 assays)
  Assay                                           Endpoint                Species
  ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  NfL/GFAP CSF+serum ELISA                        cns_toxicity            cynomolgus
    >> Nusinersen NDA precedent; FDA 2022 IT oligo guidance.
  Renal H&E + PAS + LAMP1 IHC                     renal_accumulation      rat
    >> PS-ASO lysosomal renal accumulation. Rat caveat.
  Recovery satellite group (28d)                  hepatocellular_injury   rat
    >> Reversibility of liver/kidney findings.

  P3 -- Exploratory (3 assays)
  Assay                                           Endpoint                Species
  ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  TLR7/8/9 reporter assay (HEK-Blue)              innate_immune_activatio human cell line
    >> Sequence-based TLRpred upgrade; upgrades regex to probability scores.
  immuneSIM repertoire simulation                 innate_immune_activatio in silico
    >> Validate innate immune module against simulated immune repertoire.
  ChEMBL/SIDER DILI flag check                    hepatocellular_injury   database
    >> Programmatic DILI flag from approved drug comparator database.

==============================================================================
  Translational Bridge -- OTX-004-IT-lncRNA-NEAT1
==============================================================================
  Translational Bridge | OTX-004-IT-lncRNA-NEAT1 | Species: cynomolgus
  Endpoint                      Preclinical             Clinical          Risk
  ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  cns_toxicity                  NfL/GFAP CSF+serum; TDP Serum NfL+GFAP; C 0.900
    -> Nusinersen NDA NfL/GFAP precedent; FDA 2022 IT oligo guidance.
  thrombocytopenia              CBC; PF4-PS; C3d/C4d fl CBC; anti-PF4 Ab; 0.450
    -> Phase 1 CBC weekly; anti-PF4 if PLT drops >30%.
  innate_immune_activation      TLR7/8/9; RIG-I/MDA-5;  IFN-a; PBMC; cyto 0.450
    -> IFN-a monitoring Phase 1 per ICH S7B guidance.
  offtarget_gene_silencing      RNA-seq; seed alignment Target PD; transc 0.450
    -> Human-specific sequences require human transcriptomics (ICH S6R1).
  renal_tubular_injury          KIM-1/NGAL/clusterin; H eGFR; ACR; urine  0.417
    -> Do not use rat renal for human extrapolation (ICH S7A).
  hepatocellular_injury         ALT/AST/GDH/H&E/casp-3  ALT/AST; Hy Law   0.387
    -> ICH S2R1/S7A. NOAEL-based safety margin. Hy Law per FDA DILI 2009.
  coagulation_effect            APTT/PT/fibrinogen/ATII APTT; PT; fibrino 0.375
    -> Nusinersen APTT monitoring precedent.
  cytokine_release              MSD/Luminex; Trp:Kyn; I IL-6/TNF-a; Trp:K 0.350
    -> ASTCT CRS grading; IL-6 primary monitoring analyte.
  renal_accumulation            H&E+PAS+LAMP1; tissue T eGFR; urine prote 0.342
    -> Same caveat as renal tubular injury.
  injection_site_reaction       SC ISR H&E+IHC; cytokin ISR scoring; biop 0.193
    -> ISR per inclisiran/nusinersen label precedent.
  kupffer_cell_activation       CD68/F4/80 IHC; cytokin CRP; ferritin; cy 0.150
    -> Correlated with histopathology and biomarker data.
  hepatic_vacuolation           H&E; Oil Red O; LAMP1   ALT; liver imagin 0.003
    -> GLP histopathology; reversibility satellite group.
  complement_activation         C3a/C5a/SC5b-9/CH50/AH5 C3/C4/CH50; infus 0.000
    -> Patisiran IND CARPA framework; FDA IV oligo guidance.

  Species Caveats:
    * Cynomolgus ASGPR and complement closely model human.
    * Preferred species for complement, platelet, and hepatic endpoints.
    * DART: EFD MPS or surrogate sequence; pre-IND FDA/EMA consult.
    * lncRNA: verify cynomolgus ortholog; hub network analysis required.

